url: "https://rohanvarshney.github.io/SpotKit/"
abstract: "A suite of client-side web utilities for ranking top albums using Bayesian completion scoring (TopAlbums), visualizing Extended Streaming History archives (SESH), sequencing playlists by harmonic key and BPM (DJMyPlaylist), and interactively building sets with branching track selection and revert (MakeASet)."
